flowchart TB
    subgraph Clients[Clients and operators]
        Wallet[UTXOWallet / Wallet]
        RPCClient[JSON-RPC client]
        Peer[Remote peer]
        Operator[Operator / snapshot tooling]
    end

    subgraph Node[AetherChain node]
        RPC[RPCNode\nThreadingHTTPServer]
        P2P[P2PNode\nnewline-delimited TCP]
        Mempool[Mempool\nRLock + conflict reservation]
        Chain[Blockchain\nPoW + replay + fork choice]
        Block[Block\nheader + Merkle root + state root]
        State[UTXOState\natomic staging + state_root]
        Crypto[crypto.py\nsecp256k1 ECDSA]
        Ledger[ledger.py\ntransactions + UTXO rules]
        Storage[storage.py\natomic JSON snapshots]
        NodeRuntime[Node\nunified lifecycle]
    end

    Wallet -->|sign transaction| Crypto
    Wallet --> Ledger
    RPCClient -->|HTTP JSON-RPC| RPC
    Peer <-->|TCP JSON messages| P2P
    Operator -->|save/load| Storage

    RPC -->|submit signed tx| Mempool
    P2P -->|submit signed tx| Mempool
    RPC -->|read height, balance, blocks| Chain
    P2P -->|validate blocks/chains| Chain
    Mempool -->|candidate batch| Chain
    Crypto -->|verify ownership/signatures| Ledger
    Ledger -->|apply staged txs| State
    Chain -->|mine and validate| Block
    Chain -->|commit/replay| State
    Storage -->|restore validated chain| Chain
    Block -->|header commits| State
    NodeRuntime -->|owns lifecycle| RPC
    NodeRuntime -->|owns lifecycle| P2P
    NodeRuntime -->|mines and snapshots| Chain

